{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the captivating world of &quot;The Bast&quot; with Remnants of the Rift - First Run (Original Soundtrack), an EP featuring 6 tracks that offer your initial immersion into the game's amazing world and intriguing characters. Inspired by the game's core concept of seventies retro-futurism, this EP takes you on a journey through diverse genres and sounds, blending whimsical psychedelic explorations with hard rock and modern experimental music, progressively fusing analogue synthesis, recorded instruments, and digital soundscapes as you venture into your first run. Get ready to discover the game as new music gets released soon, and stay tuned in the coming weeks for the full album!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768910?t=1749135275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768910?t=1749135275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768910/a80029be42c1b146f98646315706c8b864448d71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749135275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768910/a80029be42c1b146f98646315706c8b864448d71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749135275","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the captivating world of &quot;The Bast&quot; with Remnants of the Rift - First Run (Original Soundtrack), an EP featuring 6 tracks that offer your initial immersion into the game's amazing world and intriguing characters. Inspired by the game's core concept of seventies retro-futurism, this EP takes you on a journey through diverse genres and sounds, blending whimsical psychedelic explorations with hard rock and modern experimental music, progressively fusing analogue synthesis, recorded instruments, and digital soundscapes as you venture into your first run. Get ready to discover the game as n